    "不实现或修改 Continuation launcher/coordinator 的生产流程",
    "不解析模型 final reply 或 agentMessage 来补 receipt 字段",
    "不从 CompressionRequest 回显 Source revision",
    "不复用 Source Thread、旧 Compression Thread 或旧 attempt 产物",
    "不授予 Project Write Lease",
    "不在 Source 工作区写默认 Handoff 文件"
  ],
